    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectral Sonata is a first-person psychological horror game that immerses players in a hauntingly beautiful mansion. As you navigate its ever-changing corridors, you\u2019ll uncover the story of a prodigious musician whose soul is entwined with the very fabric of the estate and the horrors that happened there. Experience a chilling atmosphere where every creak and whisper adds to the tension, keeping you on edge throughout your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/c9d64de00679bab9e1e7698cfd6254e4.avif?t=1750418792\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a grand, decaying mansion where no two visits are ever the same. Delve into the mansion\u2019s secrets, discovering hidden passages and unraveling the mysteries that lie within.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/374c487023ef5ccc6958d38c03a3bc29.poster.avif?t=1750418792\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/374c487023ef5ccc6958d38c03a3bc29.webm?t=1750418792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/374c487023ef5ccc6958d38c03a3bc29.mp4?t=1750418792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/e541e122494eb0efeec0d74ea21eb733.avif?t=1750418792\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the musician\u2019s tragic story by finding scattered pages, notes and memories that bring the past back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/49749afc7e0ea85689c898003d25387e.poster.avif?t=1750418792\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/49749afc7e0ea85689c898003d25387e.webm?t=1750418792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/49749afc7e0ea85689c898003d25387e.mp4?t=1750418792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/b9ac4d4a9112b881ab104933dc6bb137.avif?t=1750418792\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ghost\u2019s haunting melodies resonate through the mansion. Listen closely, as they may offer reassurance but may also foreshadow menace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/e0cc9f2a3c6b2bad1fac7604598c14e9.poster.avif?t=1750418792\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/e0cc9f2a3c6b2bad1fac7604598c14e9.webm?t=1750418792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/e0cc9f2a3c6b2bad1fac7604598c14e9.mp4?t=1750418792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/52a0508bd66f26891dbb6c0da1f2abb4.avif?t=1750418792\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you escape or confront the ghost, the ending is altered by your understanding of her tragic past.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/054790dd81192f63b21e2093254a2f62.poster.avif?t=1750418792\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/054790dd81192f63b21e2093254a2f62.webm?t=1750418792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/054790dd81192f63b21e2093254a2f62.mp4?t=1750418792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to free the musician\u2019s soul, or will you become another note in the mansion\u2019s haunting melody?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an atmospheric experience built on dread, tension, and emotional unease</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mansion which changes as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together a haunting narrative through scattered notes, reading lost pages, and observing subtle environmental clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Listen closely to the music as the melodies guide, warn, and echo what\u2019s about to unfold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet, immersive narrative brought to life with haunting visuals, sparse dialogue, and a focus on atmosphere over exposition</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectral Sonata is a first-person psychological horror game that immerses players in a hauntingly beautiful mansion. As you navigate its ever-changing corridors, you\u2019ll uncover the story of a prodigious musician whose soul is entwined with the very fabric of the estate and the horrors that happened there. Experience a chilling atmosphere where every creak and whisper adds to the tension, keeping you on edge throughout your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/c9d64de00679bab9e1e7698cfd6254e4.avif?t=1750418792\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a grand, decaying mansion where no two visits are ever the same. Delve into the mansion\u2019s secrets, discovering hidden passages and unraveling the mysteries that lie within.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/374c487023ef5ccc6958d38c03a3bc29.poster.avif?t=1750418792\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/374c487023ef5ccc6958d38c03a3bc29.webm?t=1750418792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/374c487023ef5ccc6958d38c03a3bc29.mp4?t=1750418792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/e541e122494eb0efeec0d74ea21eb733.avif?t=1750418792\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the musician\u2019s tragic story by finding scattered pages, notes and memories that bring the past back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/49749afc7e0ea85689c898003d25387e.poster.avif?t=1750418792\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/49749afc7e0ea85689c898003d25387e.webm?t=1750418792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/49749afc7e0ea85689c898003d25387e.mp4?t=1750418792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/b9ac4d4a9112b881ab104933dc6bb137.avif?t=1750418792\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ghost\u2019s haunting melodies resonate through the mansion. Listen closely, as they may offer reassurance but may also foreshadow menace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/e0cc9f2a3c6b2bad1fac7604598c14e9.poster.avif?t=1750418792\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/e0cc9f2a3c6b2bad1fac7604598c14e9.webm?t=1750418792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/e0cc9f2a3c6b2bad1fac7604598c14e9.mp4?t=1750418792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/52a0508bd66f26891dbb6c0da1f2abb4.avif?t=1750418792\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you escape or confront the ghost, the ending is altered by your understanding of her tragic past.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/054790dd81192f63b21e2093254a2f62.poster.avif?t=1750418792\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/054790dd81192f63b21e2093254a2f62.webm?t=1750418792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/054790dd81192f63b21e2093254a2f62.mp4?t=1750418792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to free the musician\u2019s soul, or will you become another note in the mansion\u2019s haunting melody?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an atmospheric experience built on dread, tension, and emotional unease</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mansion which changes as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together a haunting narrative through scattered notes, reading lost pages, and observing subtle environmental clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Listen closely to the music as the melodies guide, warn, and echo what\u2019s about to unfold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet, immersive narrative brought to life with haunting visuals, sparse dialogue, and a focus on atmosphere over exposition</p></li></ul>",
